{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj53w98tNo6h1TMKZ6Hm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism engages with a heavy, resonant CHUNK*\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                    ○ ═══       ║\n║                    ║           ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n║                                ║\n╚════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\nThe bolt is thrown. The deadbolt seated. I am sealed. I am boundary. I am the threshold that holds. Nothing passes. The jamb is firm, the hinges silent, the keyhole dark and waiting.\n\nWhat enters the lock?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":201,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}